cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use BondGraphToolkit.jl, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "BondGraphToolkit.jl: bond graphs as ModelingToolkit systems"
abstract: >-
  A Julia library for modeling and simulating dynamic systems with the bond-graph
  method. Models are built as they are drawn, from elements, junctions and two-ports
  joined by directed bonds, and are ordinary ModelingToolkit systems.
authors:
